graph LR
    KRP["kube-rbac-proxy<br/>v0.21.1 (odh-kube-rbac-proxy-rhel9)"]

    %% Runtime external dependencies
    KRP -->|TokenReview / SAR<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server"]
    KRP -.->|JWKS / discovery<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, optional| OIDC["OIDC Provider"]
    KRP -->|forward allowed requests<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP localhost| Upstream["Protected Upstream App"]

    %% Go libraries
    KRP -->|authn/authz factories, OIDC, union| APIServer["k8s.io/apiserver v0.35.2"]
    KRP -->|TokenReview / SAR clients| ClientGo["k8s.io/client-go v0.35.2"]
    KRP -->|API types| APIMach["k8s.io/api, apimachinery v0.35.2"]
    KRP -->|flags, logging| CompBase["k8s.io/component-base v0.35.2"]
    KRP -->|logging + token mask| Klog["k8s.io/klog/v2 v2.140.0"]
    KRP -->|HTTP/2, h2c| XNet["golang.org/x/net v0.58.0"]
    KRP -->|CLI| Cobra["spf13/cobra v1.10.2, pflag v1.0.10"]
    KRP -->|lifecycle| OklogRun["oklog/run v1.2.0"]
    KRP -->|audit metrics| Snoop["felixge/httpsnoop v1.1.0"]

    %% Build
    KRP -.->|build| GoToolset["Go 1.26 / UBI9 go-toolset<br/>strictfipsruntime, CGO"]
    KRP -.->|runtime base| UBI["ubi9/ubi-minimal-pqc"]

    %% Internal platform integrations
    Operators["RHOAI Component Operators<br/>rhods-operator, notebook controller,<br/>KServe, TrustyAI"] -->|inject sidecar + TLS profile flags| KRP
    Gateway["Gateway API data-science-gateway<br/>HTTPRoutes"] -->|HTTPS 8443/TCP| KRP
    Prom["OpenShift Prometheus<br/>prometheus-k8s"] -->|scrape /metrics<br/>hardcoded allow| KRP
    ServiceCA["OpenShift service-serving certs"] -.->|serving cert Secret| KRP
    KRP -.->|OCSF audit on stdout| LogColl["Log collection"]

